# RUN: python3 %S/native-owned-global-maps.py --translate ctjs-translate --opt ctjs-opt --work %t

# A published setter takes independently proved primitive actuals while the
# sibling getter retains its zero-argument signature. Saved typed C++ callables
# receive new keys after startup and retain the same Map after owner release.
# Missing, extra, mixed and unproved actuals must preserve every source call.
# Primitive-producing sibling calls retain their typed results and runtime
# order, including two mutating actuals, repeated calls and local aliases.
# Missing/unknown/mixed results and circular evidence remain refusals.
# Method-local per-key set facts prove a later get only for its same live key and
# independently typed payload. Possible same-key writes join payload tags while
# preserving definite presence; repeated writes, saved keys and distinct formal
# actuals retain runtime lookups, result operands and the shared Map lifetime.
# Missing, deleted, cleared and incompatibly joined facts refuse. An exact-key
# reseed restores its own tag without authorizing unsupported payload carriers.
# Distinct definite keys bound the size of their runtime Map; saved size reads
# retain that bound after later growth or deletion of every seeded key. Aliases
# preserve the snapshot. Repeated and possibly equal SSA keys never count twice.
# Removed entries and reads before later seeding cannot inflate the bound;
# equal positive keys/snapshots can alias and must refuse without changing calls.
# Blinded executions distinguish saved/current size and real deletion; fresh/stale
# forged presence, reruns and budget cutoffs stay bounded.
# Homogeneous Bool/String payloads retain typed producer/consumer calls. False
# and empty string overwrite present keys while missing values stay refused;
# blinded observations distinguish each from undefined. A saved owning string
# survives payload overwrite/deletion, caller-buffer mutation, entry reexecution
# and final Map destruction under ASan/UBSan. Closed Bool/Number and Bool/String
# Map storage preserves each key tag
# and exact live read result. Missing/mismatched payloads and Number/String storage
# retain their calls and refuse fresh/stale forged presence and read-type facts.
# Saved Bool/Number/String reads retain independent scalar facts through a later
# nonliteral write and another mixed Map read, including repeated published calls.
# Mutation-blind controls distinguish skipped writes/deletes and rereading an old
# source entry. Current literal overwrites retain their actual result tags.
# Missing first/second reads refuse in both optimization modes under valid Bool
# and String forgeries, stale manifests, reruns and bounded proof cutoffs. The
# long String chain survives mutation/deletion before each consuming write/return,
# and then final Map destruction in both explicit/deduced sanitizer harnesses.
# Live conditional saved reads merge only independent same-tag scalar evidence.
# Both Boolean flag values retain producer/consumer order and every source Map
# call, including the original 16-call boundary. Distinct result keys expose
# either constant-arm substitution for String/Boolean/Number joins. Missing or
# deleted reads in either arm and different arm tags remain refusals under valid
# forged reports, stale/fresh manifests and reruns in both optimization modes.
# Incomplete budgets retain branch/yield operands and all source calls. A long
# String join sees only false at startup; saved native callables later select
# both flags after publication owners are released. Both selected strings own
# their bytes across source/writeback mutation and deletion, independent entry
# execution, caller-buffer mutation and destruction of both Maps under sanitizers.
# A fresh has guard proves a conditional read only for its same live Map/key,
# with an independently proved payload tag whenever present. Conditional delete
# joins retain that tag without inventing unconditional membership; the original
# 18-call boundary observes size 2 while its no-delete/fallback-only controls
# observe 3/1. Both flags preserve Bool/Number/String results and every Map call.
# Missing payload tags, wrong Map/key guards, stale has results, intervening
# deletes, disagreeing payload paths and literal-only predicates remain refusals.
# All retain calls and branch/yield operands under valid Bool/String forgeries,
# stale/fresh manifests, reruns and both optimization policies. Incomplete budgets
# retain source IR. A guarded long String fixture runs only false at startup;
# saved typed native callables later run both flags, own both selected strings
# across entry overwrite/delete, owner release, reentry and final Map destruction.
# Short-circuit (has && get) || fallback retains the exact eighteen-call source
# and admits only a final independently proved scalar tag. The intermediate
# false alternative cannot reach a truthy String/Number arm. Present empty
# String, false and zero must select fallback; replacing || with a guarded
# ternary changes all three observations. Distinct truthy/falsy results preserve
# runtime reads, writes, deletions and producer/consumer order in both modes.
# Missing/stale/wrong guards, mutation inside &&, missing/incompatible payloads,
# unrepresented stored payloads and an unexecuted future unknown effect remain refusals
# with source calls and branch operands intact through forgeries/reruns/budgets.
# Forged read and write tags cannot justify extracting a short-circuit carrier
# before a Map set; both tags require independent live reanalysis.
# Saved owning String results again survive both future flags, mutation and
# deletion of every source entry, independent reentry and final Map destruction.
# Finite String/Null/Undefined method results use owning nullable_string callable
# signatures. The normalized key || 'missing' consumer preserves the exact
# eighteen-call nullable_or source without requiring real null Map keys. Separate
# executed observations distinguish null, undefined, empty String and owning
# String when Map size alone hides their difference. Both flags and three-way
# String/Null/Undefined calls retain every runtime Map call and result operand.
# Unknown results, unproved reads, Number/String mixtures, object results and
# unexecuted future effects refuse fresh/stale forged read/write/key facts and
# reruns in both modes. A false-only startup's saved nullable getter later
# returns null for true; its long String snapshots retain their bytes through
# source overwrite/delete, caller-buffer mutation, independent reentry and final
# release of both Maps under ASan/UBSan. Measured budget boundaries retain the
# entire source component, signatures, branches and calls at every checked cutoff.
# The same normalized consumer also works with exclusively String Map keys.
# Owning nullable String Map keys preserve the exact eleven-call source and
# its thirteen-call String/Null/Undefined/empty-key witness (size 4). Normalizing
# the same witness observes size 2. Composing Boolean with nullable String
# preserves the original eighteen-call getter and nineteen-call per-use control.
# Normalizing one use keeps the original nullable formal at its later raw write;
# live schema proof and both writes survive fresh/stale key/read/write forgeries,
# reruns and both optimization modes. Mixed snapshots remain refused.
# A saved-key lifetime fixture deletes/reinserts keys and owns
# long String bytes after caller-buffer mutation and source overwrite/delete;
# Null, Undefined and empty String stay distinct after owner release, independent
# reentry and final destruction of both Maps under ASan/UBSan. The measured
# budget endpoints retain the original functions, branches and runtime calls.
# Nullable String payloads preserve the exact eleven-call write and twelve-call
# readback sources. A fourteen-call identity witness observes String, Null,
# Undefined and empty String through the setter's Map read; tags and bytes are
# checked separately from size. Optional Bool/String storage keeps independent
# scalar getter evidence. Unproved optional mixed reads remain unrepresented.
# Fresh/stale read/write/key forgeries, reruns and incomplete budgets cannot
# invent a payload tag or narrow the storage schema. Deleted nullable reads
# preserve the thirteen-call source and return Undefined for String, Null,
# Undefined and empty String inputs; deleting and retaining the entry differ.
# Missing producer evidence, object payload ownership and values snapshots stay refused.
# A false-only startup saves a nullable payload before overwriting and deleting
# its entry. Saved callables later run both flags, copy every nullish/String tag
# and own long String bytes through caller/result mutation, independent reentry
# and final release of both Maps under ASan/UBSan.
# Finite per-entry String/Null/Undefined facts preserve the exact fourteen-call
# trace-2 and nineteen-call trace-3 mixed-storage readbacks. A sixteen-call
# witness checks all four nullable tags independently from the Map size and
# incoming key. Broader Boolean storage and a later same-key Boolean overwrite
# cannot widen a saved owning read; its bytes and tag survive entry deletion,
# caller/result mutation, both future flags, reentry and final Map destruction.
# Missing/deleted reads and possibly-aliasing Boolean payload writes retain
# complete host ownership but refuse native output with every prepared call
# and producer/consumer operand intact. Each repair restores the exact admitted
# fourteen-call source in both modes. Fresh/stale nullable read
# markers are rederived independently from scalar write/key markers; reruns and
# measured budget cutoffs cannot manufacture presence or narrow a live union.
# The exact acyclic fifteen-call get -> set -> size(key) chain retains nullable
# payload alternatives in the independent host result proof. A substituted
# Null/Undefined/empty String/Boolean return changes its trace from 1 to 2.
# Conditional writes and saved reads before Boolean overwrite/deletion preserve
# every producer/consumer operand, all four tags, and owning String bytes.
# Saved native getter/setter/size callables survive owner release and reentry;
# returned payloads survive caller/result mutation and final Map destruction.
# Unknown/missing/deleted/aliasing host-result facts independently refuse in
# both modes; exact admitted repairs have different observations. Fresh/stale
# scalar/nullable forgeries, reruns and transactional budgets cannot supply the
# missing host evidence. Same-method nested setter census remains a separate
# fifteen-call refusal with its original trace and source operands preserved.
